('128.2.b.8.A',2,'A fairy tale often begins with:','["once upon a time", "the end", "for example", "in conclusion"]'::jsonb,0,'Fairy tales often use a traditional opening.','original'),
('128.2.b.8.B',2,'In a nursery poem, words that end with the same sound make:','["a title", "rhyme", "a list", "a map"]'::jsonb,1,'Rhyme is repeated ending sounds.','original'),
