('128.2.b.8.D.i',3,'A book about bees tells how they make honey and live in hives. The central idea is:','["how cars work", "how to bake", "how bees live", "how to swim"]'::jsonb,2,'Supporting details point to the central idea.','original'),
('128.2.b.8.D.ii',2,'A title helps you know:','["the weather", "the book''s price", "the author''s age", "what the text is about"]'::jsonb,3,'Titles give information.','original'),
