('128.2.b.9.A',2,'A funny story about a silly dog was probably written to:','["entertain", "teach math", "list rules", "sell a car"]'::jsonb,0,'The purpose is to entertain.','original'),
('128.2.b.9.B',3,'Text structure means:','["what color the cover is", "how the author organizes the writing", "how thick the book is", "who printed it"]'::jsonb,1,'Structure shows how ideas are organized.','original'),
('128.2.b.9.B',3,'An author puts steps in order to show how to make a sandwich. This structure is:','["setting", "fable", "sequence", "rhyme"]'::jsonb,2,'Sequence helps the author''s purpose.','original'),
('128.2.b.9.C',2,'Bold words and pictures in a book are:','["a size of book", "a type of ink only", "a type of paper", "print and graphic features"]'::jsonb,3,'Features highlight information.','original'),
('128.2.b.9.C',3,'An author uses a bold heading to:','["show a new topic", "hide the facts", "change the title", "end the book"]'::jsonb,0,'Headings organize information.','original'),
